      "text": "The concept of 'yum cha', which means 'drink tea', became popular in teahouses. It includes two related concepts: 'jat zung loeng gin', meaning 'one cup, two pieces', and 'dim sum', meaning 'touch the heart'.",
      "date": "0900"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Spread of Dim Sum",
      "text": "Over the centuries, dim sum spread from Cantonese cuisine to other Chinese cuisines, becoming a popular brunch tradition in various regions.",
      "date": "1500"
