      "headline": "Union of Utrecht",
      "text": "On January 23, 1579, the Union of Utrecht was signed, forming a confederation of seven northern provinces of the Spanish Netherlands. This marked the beginning of the Dutch Republic.",
      "date": "1579-01-23"
    },
    {
