      "text": "Gdańsk became a member of the Hanseatic League in 1361, which greatly enhanced its trade and economic status.",
      "date": "1361"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Thirteen Years' War",
      "text": "During the Thirteen Years' War (1454–1466), Gdańsk sided with the Kingdom of Poland against the Teutonic Order.",
      "date": "1454"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Second Peace of Thorn",
      "text": "The Second Peace of Thorn in 1466 ended the Thirteen Years' War, and Gdańsk became part of the Polish Crown.",
      "date": "1466"
