      "text": "In 1614, the first Rosicrucian manifesto, the 'Fama Fraternitatis', was published in Kassel, Germany. It announced the existence of a secret brotherhood of alchemists and sages who were preparing to transform the arts and sciences, and to bring about a new era of enlightenment.",
      "date": "1614"
    },
    {
