      "headline": "Introduction of CAN 2.0",
      "text": "The CAN 2.0 standard was introduced, offering improvements in data rate capabilities and maximum data payload sizes.",
      "date": "1991"
    },
    {
      "headline": "ISO 11898 Standard",
      "text": "The ISO 11898 standard was established, defining the physical and data link layers for CAN, further solidifying its role in automotive and other industries.",
      "date": "1993"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Development of CAN FD",
      "text": "CAN FD (Flexible Data-rate) was developed to allow for higher data rates and larger data payloads, addressing the growing need for more efficient data communication.",
      "date": "2012"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Introduction of CAN XL",
      "text": "CAN XL was introduced, providing even greater data rate capabilities and payload sizes, further expanding the applications of CAN in various industries.",
      "date": "2020"
    }
  ]
}

