    {
      "headline": "Influences on The Myth of Sisyphus",
      "text": "The essay was influenced by philosophers such as Søren Kierkegaard, Arthur Schopenhauer, and Friedrich Nietzsche. Camus explores themes of existentialism and the absurd.",
