      "text": "Claude Debussy was born on August 22, 1862, in Saint-Germain-en-Laye, France.",
      "date": "1862-08-22"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Enters Paris Conservatoire",
      "text": "In 1872, at the age of ten, Debussy entered the Paris Conservatoire, where he studied for 11 years.",
      "date": "1872"
