      "headline": "Origins of Reggae",
      "text": "Reggae music originated in Jamaica during the late 1960s. It evolved from earlier genres such as mento, ska, and rocksteady, incorporating elements of traditional Jamaican music like Kumina, Pukkumina, Revival Zion, Nyabinghi, and burru drumming.",
