      "headline": "Divorce from Albert Einstein",
      "text": "On February 14, 1919, Marić and Einstein's divorce was finalized.",
      "date": "1919-02-14"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Death of Mileva Marić",
      "text": "Mileva Marić died on August 4, 1948, in Zurich, Switzerland.",
