      "text": "By the early 2000s, DBT was recognized as an evidence-based therapy, supported by numerous studies demonstrating its effectiveness in treating various mental health conditions.",
      "date": "2000"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Global Adoption of DBT",
      "text": "DBT has been adopted globally and is used in various settings, including outpatient clinics, hospitals, and schools, to help individuals with emotional regulation and interpersonal effectiveness.",
