      "text": "Imam Bukhari, one of the most prominent Hadith scholars, was born in 810 CE. He would later compile one of the most respected collections of Hadith.",
      "date": "0810"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Compilation of Sahih Bukhari",
      "text": "Imam Bukhari completed his compilation of Sahih Bukhari, one of the most authentic collections of Hadith, around 846 CE.",
      "date": "0846"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Birth of Imam Muslim",
      "text": "Imam Muslim, another significant Hadith scholar, was born in 815 CE. He is known for compiling Sahih Muslim, another highly regarded Hadith collection.",
      "date": "0815"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Compilation of Sahih Muslim",
      "text": "Imam Muslim completed his compilation of Sahih Muslim, which is considered one of the most authentic Hadith collections, around 875 CE.",
      "date": "0875"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Development of Hadith Sciences",
      "text": "By the 9th century, the science of Hadith criticism and classification had developed, with scholars establishing criteria for evaluating the authenticity of Hadith.",
      "date": "0900"
