      "text": "Jami` at-Tirmidhi, a significant Hadith collection, was compiled by Imam Tirmidhi in the late 9th century.",
      "date": "0892"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Compilation of Sunan an-Nasa'i",
      "text": "Sunan an-Nasa'i, one of the six major Hadith collections, was compiled by Imam an-Nasa'i in the 9th century.",
