      "headline": "Escalation of the Vietnam War",
      "text": "Throughout the 1960s, McNamara was a key figure in escalating U.S. involvement in the Vietnam War.",
      "date": "1960s"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Resignation as Secretary of Defense",
      "text": "McNamara resigned as Secretary of Defense on February 29, 1968, after serving for over seven years.",
      "date": "1968-02-29"
    },
