      "headline": "Formation of the German Confederation",
      "text": "The German Confederation was established on June 8, 1815, by the Congress of Vienna. It was created as a loose association of 39 predominantly German-speaking sovereign states in Central Europe, replacing the former Holy Roman Empire.",
