      "text": "Fatima bint Muhammad was born in Mecca, present-day Saudi Arabia, around the year 605 CE. She was the daughter of the Islamic prophet Muhammad and his first wife, Khadija.",
      "date": "0605"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Marriage to Ali",
      "text": "Fatima married Ali ibn Abi Talib, her cousin and the future fourth caliph of Islam, in 624 CE. This marriage is considered highly significant in Islamic history.",
