      "headline": "Publication of 'Middlemarch'",
      "text": "George Eliot's 'Middlemarch' was published in serial form from 1871 to 1872. The novel is celebrated for its deep psychological insight and detailed depiction of provincial life.",
      "date": "1871"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Publication of 'Daniel Deronda'",
      "text": "In 1876, Eliot published 'Daniel Deronda', her final novel, which explores themes of identity, society, and Jewish culture in Victorian England.",
      "date": "1876"
    },
    {
