      "text": "The First Intifada began on December 9, 1987, following an incident in the Jabalia refugee camp in the Gaza Strip, where an Israeli Defense Forces' truck collided with a civilian car, killing four Palestinians. This event sparked widespread protests and violence across the Palestinian territories.",
