      "headline": "Ongoing Debate and Research",
      "text": "Since the initial proposal in 2016, the existence of Planet Nine has been a topic of ongoing debate and research. Some astronomers support the hypothesis, while others suggest that the observed clustering of ETNOs' orbits could be due to observational biases.",
