      "headline": "Beginning of the Rhodesian Bush War",
      "text": "The Rhodesian Bush War, also known as the Second Chimurenga, began in July 1964. It was a civil conflict in the unrecognised country of Rhodesia.",
      "date": "1964-07"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Unilateral Declaration of Independence",
      "text": "On November 11, 1965, the Rhodesian government, led by Prime Minister Ian Smith, issued a Unilateral Declaration of Independence (UDI) from the United Kingdom.",
