      "text": "In 1420, Split came under the control of the Republic of Venice, which lasted until 1797.",
      "date": "1420"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Austrian Empire",
      "text": "After the fall of Venice in 1797, Split became part of the Austrian Empire.",
      "date": "1797"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Kingdom of Yugoslavia",
      "text": "Following World War I, Split became part of the Kingdom of Yugoslavia in 1918.",
      "date": "1918"
