      "headline": "World War II Occupation",
      "text": "During World War II, Split was occupied by Italian and later German forces from 1941 to 1944.",
      "date": "1941"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Socialist Federal Republic of Yugoslavia",
      "text": "After World War II, Split became part of the Socialist Federal Republic of Yugoslavia in 1945.",
      "date": "1945"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Independence of Croatia",
      "text": "In 1991, Split became part of the newly independent Republic of Croatia following the breakup of Yugoslavia.",
