      "headline": "Publication of 'The Castle of Otranto'",
      "text": "In 1764, Horace Walpole published 'The Castle of Otranto', which is considered the first Gothic novel. This work established many of the conventions of the genre, such as a mysterious and gloomy setting, supernatural elements, and a focus on terror.",
      "date": "1764"
