    {
      "headline": "Publication of 'The Mysteries of Udolpho'",
      "text": "In 1794, Ann Radcliffe published 'The Mysteries of Udolpho', which became one of the most popular Gothic novels of its time. Radcliffe's work was known for its emphasis on atmosphere and suspense.",
      "date": "1794"
