      "text": "Johanna Osthoff, Gauss's first wife, died on October 11, 1809.",
      "date": "1809-10-11"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Marriage to Minna Waldeck",
      "text": "Gauss married Minna Waldeck on August 4, 1810.",
      "date": "1810-08-04"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Publishes 'Theoria motus corporum coelestium'",
      "text": "In 1809, Gauss published 'Theoria motus corporum coelestium', a major work on celestial mechanics.",
      "date": "1809"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Publishes 'Disquisitiones generales circa superficies curvas'",
      "text": "In 1827, Gauss published 'Disquisitiones generales circa superficies curvas', which laid the foundations of differential geometry.",
