      "text": "The Samoan Islands were first settled by Austronesian people around 1000 BCE. These early settlers are the ancestors of the modern Samoan people.",
      "date": "-1000"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Development of the Samoan Culture",
      "text": "By 500 CE, the Samoan culture had developed its distinct Polynesian characteristics, including language, social structure, and customs.",
