      "headline": "Publication of 'How Can I Help?'",
      "text": "In 1985, Ram Dass co-authored 'How Can I Help?', a book focusing on compassionate service.",
      "date": "1985"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Stroke and Recovery",
      "text": "In 1997, Ram Dass suffered a stroke, which left him with partial paralysis and expressive aphasia. He continued to teach and write after his recovery.",
