      "headline": "Formation of Haganah",
      "text": "The Haganah was founded in June 1920 as a response to the need for a unified defense organization to protect the Jewish Yishuv in the British Mandate for Palestine.",
      "date": "1920-06"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Haganah's Role in the 1929 Palestine Riots",
      "text": "In August 1929, the Haganah played a crucial role in defending Jewish communities during the violent riots that erupted across Palestine.",
