      "text": "The earliest evidence of wine production dates back to around 6000 BCE in what is now Georgia. Archaeological findings include pottery fragments with traces of wine.",
      "date": "-6000"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Wine Production in Ancient Iran",
      "text": "Evidence of wine production in Iran dates back to around 5000 BCE, with findings of wine jars in the Zagros Mountains.",
      "date": "-5000"
