      "headline": "Arrest of Wayne Williams",
      "text": "Wayne Williams was arrested on June 21, 1981, for the murders of Nathaniel Cater and Jimmy Ray Payne, two adult victims.",
      "date": "1981-06-21"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Trial and Conviction of Wayne Williams",
      "text": "Wayne Williams was tried and convicted in February 1982 for the murders of Nathaniel Cater and Jimmy Ray Payne. He was sentenced to two consecutive life terms.",
      "date": "1982-02"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Closure of the Case",
      "text": "After the conviction of Wayne Williams, the Atlanta child murders case was officially closed, although questions and controversies remain.",
      "date": "1982"
