      "headline": "Establishment of Arlington National Cemetery",
      "text": "Arlington National Cemetery was established on June 15, 1864, during the American Civil War, on the grounds of Arlington House, which had been the estate of the family of Confederate General Robert E. Lee's wife, Mary Anna Custis Lee.",
      "date": "1864-06-15"
    },
