    {
      "headline": "End of the Draft",
      "text": "The draft ended in 1973, transitioning the U.S. military to an all-volunteer force.",
      "date": "1973"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Reinstatement of Registration Requirement",
      "text": "In 1980, President Jimmy Carter reinstated the requirement for men to register with the Selective Service System in response to the Soviet invasion of Afghanistan.",
