      "headline": "Introduction to the Mathematical Community",
      "text": "The conjecture was introduced to the wider mathematical community in the 1950s. It gained attention due to its simple formulation yet complex behavior.",
      "date": "1950"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Verification for Large Numbers",
      "text": "By 2023, the conjecture has been verified for all positive integers up to 2.95×10^20. Despite this extensive verification, a general proof remains elusive.",
