      "text": "The U.S. Food and Drug Administration (FDA) approved citalopram for use in the United States in 1998. It was marketed under the brand name Celexa.",
      "date": "1998"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Patent Expiry and Generic Availability",
      "text": "The patent for citalopram expired in 2003, allowing generic versions of the drug to become available.",
      "date": "2003"
    },
