    {
      "headline": "Spying the Land of Canaan",
      "text": "Joshua was one of the twelve spies sent by Moses to explore the land of Canaan. He and Caleb were the only two spies who brought back a positive report and encouraged the Israelites to take the land.",
      "date": "-1445"
