      "headline": "Presidency of the International Olympic Committee",
      "text": "Pierre de Coubertin served as the second president of the International Olympic Committee from 1896 to 1925.",
      "date": "1896"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Retirement from the IOC",
      "text": "In 1925, Pierre de Coubertin retired from his position as president of the International Olympic Committee.",
      "date": "1925"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Death of Pierre de Coubertin",
      "text": "Pierre de Coubertin died on September 2, 1937, in Geneva, Switzerland.",
      "date": "1937-09-02"
