      "headline": "Continuation of Debris Findings",
      "text": "Over the years, additional debris believed to be from Flight 370 was found on various shores of the Indian Ocean, further supporting the theory that the plane crashed in the ocean.",
      "date": "2015-2016"
    }
  ]
}

