      "text": "In 1995, Nancy Lieder, founder of the website ZetaTalk, introduced the idea of the Nibiru cataclysm. She claimed to be a contactee with extraterrestrials from the Zeta Reticuli star system and warned that a large planetary object, referred to as Nibiru or Planet X, would cause a catastrophic event on Earth.",
