      "text": "Chanakya was born in the ancient Indian subcontinent. The exact date of his birth is not known, but it is believed to be around 350 BCE.",
      "date": "-0350"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Education and Early Life",
      "text": "Chanakya received his education at Takshashila, an ancient center of learning in India, where he studied various subjects including economics, politics, and military strategy.",
