      "text": "Chanakya is traditionally credited with authoring the Arthashastra, an ancient Indian treatise on statecraft, economic policy, and military strategy, around 300 BCE.",
      "date": "-0300"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Advisory Role to Bindusara",
      "text": "After Chandragupta's abdication, Chanakya continued to serve as an advisor to his son, Bindusara, the second Mauryan emperor.",
