      "headline": "Roman Conquest",
      "text": "The Romans began their conquest of the Iberian Peninsula, including the Basque region, around 218 BCE. The Basque Country was never fully subjugated by the Romans.",
      "date": "-0218"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Christianization",
      "text": "The Basque Country began to be Christianized during the late Roman Empire period, around the 4th to 5th centuries CE.",
      "date": "0400"
