      "headline": "Abolition of the Slave Trade Act Passed",
      "text": "On March 25, 1807, after years of persistent campaigning, the Abolition of the Slave Trade Act was passed, making the slave trade illegal in the British Empire.",
      "date": "1807-03-25"
