      "text": "Yoweri Kaguta Museveni was born on August 15, 1944, in Ntungamo, Uganda.",
      "date": "1944-08-15"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Education in Tanzania",
      "text": "In the 1960s, Museveni attended the University of Dar es Salaam in Tanzania, where he studied economics and political science.",
      "date": "1960"
    },
