      "date": "2009-05-31"
    },
    {
      "headline": "James Cameron Solo Dive",
      "text": "On March 26, 2012, filmmaker James Cameron made a solo dive to the Challenger Deep in the Deepsea Challenger submersible, reaching a depth of 10,908 meters.",
      "date": "2012-03-26"
    },
    {
      "headline": "DSV Limiting Factor Dive",
