      "headline": "Establishment of JSOC",
      "text": "The Joint Special Operations Command (JSOC) was established in 1980 on the recommendation of Colonel Charlie Beckwith. This was in response to the failure of Operation Eagle Claw, a mission to rescue American hostages in Iran.",
