      "headline": "Operation Desert Storm",
      "text": "During the Gulf War in 1991, JSOC played a significant role in Operation Desert Storm, conducting special operations missions in Iraq and Kuwait.",
      "date": "1991"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Operation Gothic Serpent",
      "text": "In 1993, JSOC was involved in Operation Gothic Serpent in Somalia, which included the Battle of Mogadishu, famously depicted in the book and film 'Black Hawk Down'.",
      "date": "1993"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Operation Enduring Freedom",
      "text": "Following the September 11 attacks in 2001, JSOC was heavily involved in Operation Enduring Freedom in Afghanistan, targeting Taliban and Al-Qaeda forces.",
      "date": "2001"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Operation Iraqi Freedom",
      "text": "In 2003, JSOC units were involved in Operation Iraqi Freedom, the invasion of Iraq to overthrow Saddam Hussein.",
      "date": "2003"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Operation Neptune Spear",
      "text": "On May 2, 2011, JSOC conducted Operation Neptune Spear, which resulted in the death of Osama bin Laden in Abbottabad, Pakistan.",
      "date": "2011-05-02"
    }
  ]
}

