      "text": "The Norman Conquest of England in 1066 marks the beginning of significant linguistic changes that would lead to the development of Middle English.",
      "date": "1066"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Beginning of Middle English Period",
      "text": "The Middle English period is generally considered to have begun around 1150, following the Norman Conquest and the subsequent influence of Norman French on the English language.",
      "date": "1150"
