      "headline": "Final Passage by Congress",
      "text": "The final version of the Tax Cuts and Jobs Act was passed by the House on December 20, 2017, and by the Senate later that same day.",
      "date": "2017-12-20"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Signing into Law",
      "text": "President Donald Trump signed the Tax Cuts and Jobs Act into law on December 22, 2017. This marked the enactment of the most sweeping tax overhaul in decades.",
      "date": "2017-12-22"
    },
