      "headline": "Rise of Irish Influence",
      "text": "After 1850, due to mass immigration from Ireland during and after the Irish Famine of the late 1840s, the vast majority of Tammany Hall's district and precinct leaders were Irish Catholics.",
      "date": "1850"
