      "text": "On 15 July 1974, a coup d'état was carried out by the Cypriot National Guard and the Greek military junta, overthrowing President Makarios III and installing Nikos Sampson as the de facto leader.",
      "date": "1974-07-15"
    },
    {
      "headline": "First Phase of Turkish Invasion",
      "text": "On 20 July 1974, Turkey launched a military invasion of Cyprus, citing the need to protect the Turkish Cypriot minority following the coup. This marked the beginning of the first phase of the invasion.",
      "date": "1974-07-20"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Ceasefire Agreement",
      "text": "A ceasefire was agreed upon on 22 July 1974, but fighting continued sporadically as Turkish forces consolidated their positions.",
