    },
    {
      "headline": "Return to Nigeria",
      "text": "In 1963, Fela Kuti returned to Nigeria and reformed Koola Lobitos.",
      "date": "1963"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Creation of Afrobeat",
      "text": "In the late 1960s, Fela Kuti developed the Afrobeat genre, combining traditional African music with jazz, funk, and highlife.",
