      "text": "In 1666, Leibniz published his first book, 'Dissertatio de Arte Combinatoria', which explored combinatorial mathematics.",
      "date": "1666"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Entered the service of the Elector of Mainz",
      "text": "In 1672, Leibniz entered the service of Johann Philipp von Schönborn, the Elector of Mainz, as a diplomat.",
