      "headline": "Foundation of the Party for Freedom",
      "text": "The Party for Freedom (Partij voor de Vrijheid, PVV) was founded by Geert Wilders after he left the People's Party for Freedom and Democracy (VVD) due to disagreements over Turkey's potential accession to the European Union. The party was officially established in 2006.",
      "date": "2006"
    },
