    },
    {
      "headline": "Formed the band West, Bruce & Laing",
      "text": "In 1972, Jack Bruce formed the band West, Bruce & Laing with Leslie West and Corky Laing. The band released several albums before disbanding in 1974.",
      "date": "1972"
