{
  "timeline": [
    {
      "headline": "Formation of The Mars Volta",
      "text": "The Mars Volta was formed in 2001 by Omar Rodríguez-López and Cedric Bixler-Zavala, following the breakup of their previous band, At the Drive-In.",
