    {
      "headline": "Release of Debut Album 'De-Loused in the Comatorium'",
      "text": "The Mars Volta released their debut studio album, 'De-Loused in the Comatorium', on June 24, 2003. The album was a concept album based on the story of a man in a week-long coma.",
