    },
    {
      "headline": "Release of 'Frances the Mute'",
      "text": "On March 1, 2005, The Mars Volta released their second studio album, 'Frances the Mute'. The album continued their exploration of progressive rock and was inspired by a diary found by band member Jeremy Ward.",
