    },
    {
      "headline": "Release of 'Amputechture'",
      "text": "The band's third studio album, 'Amputechture', was released on September 12, 2006. The album marked a shift in their musical style, incorporating more jazz and Latin influences.",
      "date": "2006-09-12"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Release of 'The Bedlam in Goliath'",
      "text": "On January 29, 2008, The Mars Volta released 'The Bedlam in Goliath'. The album was influenced by a series of supernatural events experienced by the band during its creation.",
