      "headline": "Patent Granted",
      "text": "The patent for the computer mouse was granted to Douglas Engelbart on November 17, 1970, under the title 'X-Y Position Indicator for a Display System'.",
      "date": "1970-11-17"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Introduction of the Ball Mouse",
      "text": "The ball mouse, which used a rolling ball to detect movement, was developed by Bill English at Xerox PARC in 1972.",
