      "headline": "Formation of Gujarat Legislative Assembly",
      "text": "The Gujarat Legislative Assembly was formed in 1960 following the bifurcation of the state of Bombay into Maharashtra and Gujarat. The assembly was established to serve as the unicameral legislature of the newly created state of Gujarat.",
      "date": "1960"
    },
