      "headline": "Introduction of the P versus NP Problem",
      "text": "The P versus NP problem was introduced by Stephen Cook in 1971 in his seminal paper 'The Complexity of Theorem-Proving Procedures'. This paper was presented at the ACM Symposium on Theory of Computing.",
      "date": "1971"
    },
