      "headline": "Ramanuja's Influence",
      "text": "In the 11th century, the philosopher Ramanuja played a significant role in shaping Vaishnavism by advocating the Vishishtadvaita (qualified non-dualism) philosophy.",
      "date": "1017"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Establishment of the Sri Vaishnavism Tradition",
      "text": "Ramanuja's teachings led to the establishment of the Sri Vaishnavism tradition, which became one of the major sub-sects of Vaishnavism.",
