      "headline": "Chaitanya Mahaprabhu and Gaudiya Vaishnavism",
      "text": "In the 16th century, Chaitanya Mahaprabhu founded Gaudiya Vaishnavism, which emphasizes devotion to Krishna and the practice of congregational chanting (sankirtan).",
