      "headline": "Adoption of REST by Web Services",
      "text": "Following its introduction, REST became widely adopted for web services due to its simplicity and scalability. It became a popular alternative to SOAP-based web services.",
      "date": "2000"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Growth of RESTful APIs",
      "text": "Throughout the 2000s and 2010s, RESTful APIs became the dominant method for web service communication, with major companies like Amazon, Google, and Facebook adopting REST principles for their APIs.",
