      "headline": "U.S. Calls for Olympic Boycott",
      "text": "On January 20, 1980, U.S. President Jimmy Carter announced that the United States would boycott the 1980 Summer Olympics in Moscow if Soviet troops did not withdraw from Afghanistan.",
