      "headline": "Coining of the Term 'Vegan'",
      "text": "In November 1944, Donald Watson and a group of non-dairy vegetarians in the UK coined the term 'vegan' to describe a lifestyle that excludes all forms of animal exploitation and cruelty, including the consumption of dairy and eggs.",
      "date": "1944-11"
