    },
    {
      "headline": "Dissolution of the Kingdom of Bohemia",
      "text": "The Kingdom of Bohemia effectively ceased to exist as a separate entity in 1918 with the dissolution of Austria-Hungary and the establishment of Czechoslovakia.",
