      "text": "Ferdinand II of Aragon was born on March 10, 1452, in the town of Sos del Rey Católico, in the Kingdom of Aragon.",
      "date": "1452-03-10"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Marriage to Isabella I of Castile",
      "text": "On October 19, 1469, Ferdinand married Isabella I of Castile in Valladolid, uniting the two powerful kingdoms of Aragon and Castile.",
      "date": "1469-10-19"
