      "headline": "Firebombing of Charlie Hebdo Offices",
      "text": "On November 2, 2011, the offices of Charlie Hebdo were firebombed after the magazine announced a special edition titled 'Charia Hebdo' with Muhammad as 'editor-in-chief.'",
