      "headline": "Early Concept of Railgun",
      "text": "The concept of the railgun dates back to the early 20th century when French inventor Louis Octave Fauchon-Villeplee filed a patent for an 'electric gun' in 1918.",
      "date": "1918"
    },
    {
      "headline": "First Railgun Experiment",
      "text": "The first practical railgun experiment was conducted by the German scientist Joachim Hänsler at the Berlin Institute of Technology in 1920.",
