      "headline": "Introduction of the Minimoog",
      "text": "The Minimoog, a portable synthesizer, was introduced in 1970. It became highly influential in the development of electronic music due to its affordability and ease of use.",
      "date": "1970"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Development of MIDI",
      "text": "The Musical Instrument Digital Interface (MIDI) was developed in 1983. It allowed electronic instruments and computers to communicate, revolutionizing music production.",
      "date": "1983"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Rise of House Music",
      "text": "House music, a genre of electronic dance music, emerged in Chicago in the early 1980s and gained popularity worldwide by the late 1980s.",
      "date": "1980s"
