      "headline": "Attack on the OPEC Headquarters",
      "text": "On December 21, 1975, Ramírez Sánchez led a raid on the OPEC headquarters in Vienna, Austria. The attack resulted in the deaths of three people, and Ramírez Sánchez and his team took hostages and flew to Libya.",
      "date": "1975-12-21"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Arrest and Trial in France",
      "text": "On August 14, 1994, Ramírez Sánchez was captured in Sudan by French agents and extradited to France, where he was tried and convicted for the murder of two French agents and an informant in 1975.",
