      "headline": "Invention of the Microwave Oven",
      "text": "The microwave oven was invented by Percy Spencer in 1945. Spencer, an engineer at Raytheon, discovered that microwaves could cook food when he noticed a candy bar in his pocket melted while he was working with radar technology.",
