      "headline": "Resignation from Hospital",
      "text": "In 1956, Fanon resigned from his position at the hospital, citing his opposition to French colonial rule in Algeria.",
      "date": "1956"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Publication of 'The Wretched of the Earth'",
      "text": "In 1961, Fanon published 'The Wretched of the Earth', a seminal work on decolonization and the psychology of the colonized.",
      "date": "1961"
    },
