      "headline": "Birth of Ezra Pound",
      "text": "Ezra Weston Loomis Pound was born on October 30, 1885, in Hailey, Idaho, United States.",
      "date": "1885-10-30"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Publication of 'Ripostes'",
      "text": "In 1912, Ezra Pound published 'Ripostes', a collection of poems that marked his transition to modernist poetry.",
