    },
    {
      "headline": "Establishment of the Joint Intelligence Task Force - Combating Terrorism",
      "text": "In 2003, the DIA established the Joint Intelligence Task Force - Combating Terrorism to enhance intelligence efforts against global terrorism.",
      "date": "2003"
    },
    {
      "headline": "DIA's Role in the War on Terror",
      "text": "Following the September 11 attacks in 2001, the DIA expanded its focus on counterterrorism and provided intelligence support for operations in Afghanistan and Iraq.",
