      "text": "Odoacer was born around 433. The exact date of his birth is not known, but it is estimated to be around this year.",
      "date": "0433"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Deposition of Romulus Augustulus",
      "text": "On September 4, 476, Odoacer deposed the Western Roman child emperor Romulus Augustulus. This event is traditionally considered to mark the end of the Western Roman Empire.",
      "date": "0476-09-04"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Odoacer Becomes Ruler of Italy",
      "text": "After deposing Romulus Augustulus in 476, Odoacer became the ruler of Italy, establishing his own rule over the region.",
