      "date": "1924"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Hal Lindsey's 'The Late Great Planet Earth'",
      "text": "In 1970, Hal Lindsey published 'The Late Great Planet Earth', a book that interpreted biblical prophecies through a Dispensationalist lens. It became a bestseller and further popularized Dispensationalism.",
      "date": "1970"
