      "headline": "Isolation of Graphene",
      "text": "In 2004, Andre Geim and Konstantin Novoselov at the University of Manchester successfully isolated graphene using adhesive tape to peel layers from graphite. This breakthrough led to their Nobel Prize in Physics in 2010.",
