    {
      "headline": "Introduction of the Lazzo",
      "text": "A special characteristic of commedia dell'arte, the lazzo, a joke or 'something foolish or witty', became a well-known scripted routine among performers.",
      "date": "1600"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Character of Arlecchino",
      "text": "The character Arlecchino, now better known as Harlequin, became famous for his use of pantomime, a characteristic feature of commedia dell'arte.",
      "date": "1600"
