      "headline": "Establishment of the Legion of Merit",
      "text": "The Legion of Merit was established by an act of Congress on July 20, 1942. It was created to award members of the United States Armed Forces and foreign military and political figures for exceptionally meritorious conduct in the performance of outstanding services and achievements.",
      "date": "1942-07-20"
    },
    {
