    },
    {
      "headline": "Formation of the Chinese Communist Party",
      "text": "The Chinese Communist Party (CCP) was founded in July 1921 in Shanghai, China. Mao Zedong was one of the founding members.",
      "date": "1921-07"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Autumn Harvest Uprising",
      "text": "In September 1927, Mao led the Autumn Harvest Uprising in Hunan Province, which was one of the first armed uprisings by the Chinese Communist Party.",
