      "headline": "Establishment of the FDA",
      "text": "The Food and Drug Administration (FDA) was established in 1906 with the passage of the Pure Food and Drugs Act. This act was a response to public outcry over unsanitary conditions in the food and drug industries.",
      "date": "1906"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Food, Drug, and Cosmetic Act",
      "text": "In 1938, the Food, Drug, and Cosmetic Act was passed, significantly expanding the FDA's authority. This act required new drugs to be proven safe before marketing.",
      "date": "1938"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Kefauver Harris Amendment",
      "text": "The Kefauver Harris Amendment was enacted in 1962, requiring drug manufacturers to provide proof of the effectiveness and safety of their drugs before approval.",
      "date": "1962"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Medical Device Amendments",
      "text": "In 1976, the Medical Device Amendments were passed, giving the FDA authority to regulate medical devices and ensuring their safety and effectiveness.",
      "date": "1976"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Orphan Drug Act",
      "text": "The Orphan Drug Act was passed in 1983 to encourage the development of drugs for rare diseases, providing incentives such as tax credits and market exclusivity.",
      "date": "1983"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Prescription Drug User Fee Act",
      "text": "The Prescription Drug User Fee Act (PDUFA) was enacted in 1992, allowing the FDA to collect fees from drug manufacturers to fund the new drug approval process.",
      "date": "1992"
    },
    {
      "headline": "FDA Modernization Act",
      "text": "In 1997, the FDA Modernization Act was passed to streamline the drug approval process and increase access to experimental drugs.",
      "date": "1997"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Food Safety Modernization Act",
      "text": "The Food Safety Modernization Act was signed into law in 2011, aiming to shift the focus of federal regulators from responding to contamination to preventing it.",
      "date": "2011"
    }
  ]
}

