      "headline": "Adoption of REST by Web Services",
      "text": "Following its introduction, REST became widely adopted for web services due to its simplicity and scalability. It became a standard for designing networked applications.",
      "date": "2000"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Influence on Web APIs",
      "text": "REST has significantly influenced the design of web APIs, leading to the development of RESTful APIs that adhere to REST principles, allowing for stateless communication and resource manipulation using standard HTTP methods.",
