      "text": "Smedley Darlington Butler was born on July 30, 1881, in West Chester, Pennsylvania.",
      "date": "1881-07-30"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Enlistment in the Marine Corps",
      "text": "In 1898, at the age of 16, Butler lied about his age to receive a direct commission as a second lieutenant in the United States Marine Corps.",
      "date": "1898"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Philippine–American War",
      "text": "Butler served in the Philippine–American War from 1899 to 1902, where he gained his first combat experience.",
      "date": "1899"
