      "headline": "Establishment of the Legislative Yuan",
      "text": "The Legislative Yuan was established as the unicameral legislature of the Republic of China (Taiwan) in accordance with the Constitution of the Republic of China, which was promulgated on December 25, 1946.",
      "date": "1946-12-25"
