      "text": "Napoleon Bonaparte escaped from exile on the island of Elba and returned to France, landing on the French mainland on March 1, 1815.",
      "date": "1815-03-01"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Napoleon Enters Paris",
      "text": "Napoleon entered Paris on March 20, 1815, marking the beginning of the Hundred Days.",
      "date": "1815-03-20"
