      "text": "The Cat in the Hat was published on March 12, 1957. It was written and illustrated by Theodor Geisel, known by his pen name Dr. Seuss. The book was created as a response to concerns about children's literacy and aimed to provide an engaging alternative to the traditional primers used in schools.",
