      "headline": "International Code of Nomenclature for algae, fungi, and plants",
      "text": "The International Code of Botanical Nomenclature was renamed to the International Code of Nomenclature for algae, fungi, and plants (ICN) to reflect its broader scope.",
      "date": "2011"
    }
  ]
}

