      "headline": "Development of M61 Vulcan",
      "text": "The development of the M61 Vulcan began in the late 1940s as the United States military sought a high-rate-of-fire weapon for aircraft. The project was initiated to create a cannon capable of firing at a rate of 1,000 rounds per minute.",
