      "headline": "Influence of Adi Shankara",
      "text": "Adi Shankara, an 8th-century philosopher, played a significant role in the spread of Advaita Vedanta, which influenced many Shaiva traditions by integrating non-dualistic ideas.",
      "date": "0788"
