      "text": "In 1596, John Smith began his military career, fighting for the Dutch against the Spanish in the Eighty Years' War.",
      "date": "1596"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Service in Hungary and Captivity",
      "text": "In 1601, Smith fought for the Habsburgs in Hungary against the Ottoman Empire. He was captured and enslaved by the Ottomans but escaped in 1602.",
