    {
      "headline": "End of the Kamakura Shogunate",
      "text": "In 1333, the Kamakura Shogunate was overthrown by Emperor Go-Daigo, leading to the brief restoration of imperial rule.",
      "date": "1333"
    },
    {
      "headline": "Establishment of the Ashikaga Shogunate",
      "text": "In 1336, Ashikaga Takauji established the Ashikaga Shogunate, also known as the Muromachi Shogunate, which lasted until 1573.",
