      "headline": "Casualties and Damage",
      "text": "The Loma Prieta earthquake was responsible for 63 deaths and 3,757 injuries. It caused significant damage in the San Francisco Bay Area, including the collapse of a section of the San Francisco–Oakland Bay Bridge and the Cypress Street Viaduct.",
