      "text": "In 1895, Alfred Nobel's will established the Nobel Prizes, including the Nobel Prize in Physics, to be awarded for outstanding contributions to mankind.",
      "date": "1895"
    },
    {
      "headline": "First Nobel Prize in Physics Awarded",
      "text": "The first Nobel Prize in Physics was awarded in 1901 to Wilhelm Conrad Röntgen for the discovery of X-rays.",
