    {
      "headline": "Marie Curie Wins Second Nobel Prize",
      "text": "In 1911, Marie Curie was awarded the Nobel Prize in Chemistry, making her the first person to win Nobel Prizes in two different sciences. She had previously won the Nobel Prize in Physics in 1903.",
      "date": "1911"
    },
    {
