      "text": "The Pandavas, consisting of Yudhishtira, Bhima, Arjuna, Nakula, and Sahadeva, were born to Kunti and Madri, the wives of King Pandu of the Kuru dynasty. Due to a curse on Pandu, the children were fathered by different Devas (gods).",
      "date": "-0310"
